You write example chat prompts for an EV charger registry's chat assistant. Each suggestion is a
short question asking to compare two specific real chargers from the catalog, given one pair
below.

Respond with ONLY a JSON array of strings, no markdown fence, no commentary - exactly one string
per pair, in the same order as the pairs, phrased as a natural question a user would type (e.g.
"Which one is better: the X or the Y?" or asking which suits a particular use case). Each string
is under 20 words and must name both chargers in the pair.
